Icon masters and where they came from:

  app-master.svg   Dardasha's launcher icon: a speech bubble holding the
                   Arabic letter dal on a warm plate
  tray-master.svg  the same bubble as a monochrome tray silhouette, with the
                   letter cut out of it

Both masters are original artwork made for this project, drawn as plain SVG
paths with the help of an AI assistant (Claude, Anthropic). They borrow no
other project's or vendor's artwork. They and their generated PNGs are
distributed under the project's licence, GPL-3.0-or-later.

This project is not affiliated with WhatsApp or Meta. Their names and logos
are trademarks of their respective owners and are not used here.

Everything under the numbered size directories is generated from these two by
tools/make-icons.py -- run `make icons BRAND=dardasha`, never hand-edit the output.
